       "content": "## Finding the Value of $x$\n\n**Step 1: Set up the equation.**\n\nThe arithmetic mean of 7, 2, $x$, and 10 is 9, so:\n\n$$\\frac{7 + 2 + x + 10}{4} = 9$$\n\n**Step 2: Simplify the numerator.**\n\n$$\\frac{19 + x}{4} = 9$$\n\n**Step 3: Multiply both sides by 4.**\n\n$$19 + x = 36$$\n\n**Step 4: Solve for $x$.**\n\n$$x = 36 - 19 = 17$$\n\n**Check:** $\\frac{7 + 2 + 17 + 10}{4} = \\frac{36}{4} = 9$ \u2713\n\n$$\\boxed{17}$$",
